<title>INDIA: India 96/97 tea output seen at 790 mln kg.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 tea output seen at 790 mln kg.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The India government said on Tuesday that 1996/97 (July-June) tea production is forecast to rise to 790 million kg from 762.4 million in 1995/96.</p>
<p>It said in the annual Economic Survey that 1996/97 tea exports are projected to rise to 180 million kg from 163.7 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
